   * Expecting:
   *  <[0x10, 0x20]>
   * to contain:
   *  <[0x30]>
   * but could not find:
   *  <[0x30]></code></pre>
   *
   * @return {@code this} assertion object.
   */
  @Override
  public SELF inHexadecimal() {
    return super.inHexadecimal();
  }

